---
/** "Limits of this data": what this section can't tell you. Tap to open; always printed open. */
---
<details class="limits small">
  <summary>Limits of this data</summary>
  <div class="lbody"><slot /></div>
</details>
<style>
  .limits { border-left: 3px solid var(--border-strong); padding: 2px 0 2px 12px; color: var(--text-2); margin-top: 12px; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; min-height: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; color: var(--text); }
  .lbody { padding-bottom: 4px; }
</style>
